{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RdbYvHeFQVsj49YGKkpBuq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Farmers Markets Analysis\n\n**Territories to Exclude:**\n- Puerto Rico (PR)\n- Virgin Islands (VI)\n\n**Total Farmers Markets (US States Only): 8,715**\n\nThis sum includes all 50 states and Washington, D.C., calculated by adding the `farmers_markets` column for these jurisdictions while excluding the two US territories.\n\n**Breakdown of excluded territories:**\n- Puerto Rico: 2 farmers markets\n- Virgin Islands: 0 farmers markets\n\nThe largest markets are found in California (647), New York (555), and Pennsylvania (426), which together account for approximately 18% of the national total."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"175f9109-7f59-4ef3-aac0-6d4317b08a34","uuid":"9b07ff93-7c11-4fd8-a469-477d1f15d4d3","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:08:38.804Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Farmers Markets Analysis\n\n**Territories to Exclude:**\n- Puerto Rico (PR)\n- Virgin Islands (VI)\n\n**Total Farmers Markets (US States Only): 8,715**\n\nThis sum includes all 50 states and Washington, D.C., calculated by adding the `farmers_markets` column for these jurisdictions while excluding the two US territories.\n\n**Breakdown of excluded territories:**\n- Puerto Rico: 2 farmers markets\n- Virgin Islands: 0 farmers markets\n\nThe largest markets are found in California (647), New York (555), and Pennsylvania (426), which together account for approximately 18% of the national total.","durationMs":2856,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
